# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data layers
#
# Runtime pipeline output under data/ must not be committed. Sample fixtures
# under data/sample/ ARE part of the repo: pytest and the local ingestion
# scripts read them. Do not `git rm --cached data/` after adding these rules
# or the fixtures disappear from CI checkouts.
#
# Use `data/*` (not `data/`) so the negation rules can re-include files.
# An ignored directory is not descended into, so `data/` + `!data/sample/`
# would silently drop the fixtures.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*
!data/sample/
!data/sample/**

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Spark / JVM
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
spark-warehouse/
metastore_db/
derby.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
